<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Roche bearer shares.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Roche bearer shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corporation said it has issued 1.5 million American-style call warrants, on Roche bearer shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One share is represented by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    17000 CHF		 PREMIUM	15.26 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     9.80 CHF		  GEARING	15.92 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	30.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	19.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  15600 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
